{"articleNo":"648","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=648&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009-1학기 영어성적우수장학금 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.11","hit":"16535","attachments":[{"name":"영어성적운영방침.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=648&attachNo=69366"},{"name":"영어성적우수장학금신청안내(2009-1).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=648&attachNo=69367"},{"name":"장학금신청서(영어).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=648&attachNo=69368"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><strong>2009-1학기 영어성적우수장학금 신청 안내</strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">1. 지원자격</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교에 재학하고 있는 학생 중 8학기 이내 등록한 학생</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(2009년 8월 졸업대상자 신청 불가능)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 장학금 신청 해당학기의 성적이 2.5 이상이며, 최소 이수 학점은</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 15학점(다만, 4학년은 8학점) 이상인 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\">&nbsp; <font color=\"#0000ff\">다. 기준점수 제출자의 영어성적은 제한없음-추후 제출점수는 600점 이상</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">2. 선발 방법</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 다음과 같은 평가 점수가 우수한자 순</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;평가 점수 = 100×(제출점수 - 기준 점수)/(1100-제출점수)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; + (제출점수 - 기준점수)/5</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학부 및 전공과 무관하게 평가점수 우수자 순으로 선발</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 영어와 관련된 교내외 타 장학금과 중복 지급은 불가능하나, 이 외 타장학금과는 중복가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 2008-2학기 영어성적우수장학금 지급자 중 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">2009-1학기 기준점수가 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2008-2학기 제출점수보다 낮은 학생은 장학금 지급대상에서 제외 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (2008-2학기 영어성적장학생은 제출점수와 동일하거나=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"&gt;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">3. 장학 금액 및 지급 시기</font></span></font></span></p><font face=\"굴림체\">\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 장학금액 : 400,000원/학기</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 지급시기 : 1월에 기준 점수를 제출하고 7월에 장학금을 신청한자는 8월 중, 7월에 기준점수를 제출하고 익년 1월에 장학금을 신청한자는 2월 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;중에 지급</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">4. 영어성적표 제출기간 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">2009.2.17(화) ~2009.2.20(금)-기한경과 후 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청불가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: red; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;- 공인 영어 성적표는 제출일 기준 6개월 이내 것만 유효함</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">5. 영어성적표 제출장소 :&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">각학부 종합학사행정실 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;테크노관종합학사행정실 : 054-478-7360&nbsp;&nbsp; 테크노관 105호</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;디지털관종합학사행정실 : 054-478-7752&nbsp; 디지털관 124호 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;글로벌관종합학사행정실 : 054-478-7597&nbsp; 글로벌관 127호 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\">※ 기타문의사항 : 054-478-7045</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><strong>2009. 02. 03.</strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><strong>학&nbsp;&nbsp; 생&nbsp;&nbsp; 과&nbsp;&nbsp; 장</strong></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            </font>"}
